        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 05-S7 Stainless Steel Square Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA modern styled stainless steel square door knob with a square rose. Fusion Hardware's 05-S7 is available in brushed stainless steel finish. The square shape allows for this modern material knob and rose set to look great in all contemporary decors. It is backed by a lifetime warranty. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 05-S7 Square Stainless Steel Knob With Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Simple 05-S7 Stainless Steel Square Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Knob: 2\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Knob projection:  1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length:  2-7/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is  discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/knobs\">Door Knobs</a></b>\r\n</p>",
